...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

util_tools: 보조 도구 (estimate_renovation_cost) { class: ours }
visual_assessor: 시각 분석 에이전트 (VisualAssessor) { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }

visual_assessor -> util_tools: estimate_renovation_cost(room_type, scope, sqft)
util_tools -> visual_assessor: 견적 문자열
visual_assessor -> gemini: function_response ×2
gemini -> visual_assessor: ASSESSMENT COMPLETE 텍스트
